 viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"23\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_user_check on_unfollow\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow Lost Rabbit Digital</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following Lost Rabbit Digital</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=add_to_collection&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Flost-rabbit-digital.itch.io%2Fxerophobia\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://lost-rabbit-digital.itch.io/xerophobia/community\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Community</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a href=\"https://lost-rabbit-digital.itch.io/xerophobia/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_news\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/1296559/xerophobia\" data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_map\" role=\"img\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Xerophobia</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_1216255\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://lost-rabbit-digital.itch.io/xerophobia/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h3>Something under the sand can hear you.</h3>\r\n<p>Xerophobia is a co-op horror survival game for one to four players. Your survey crew is flown into a dead desert valley at night to restart a generator and get out again. The valley belongs to the Scolomorph: a hunter that feels every footstep, every dropped battery and every word you say.</p>\r\n<p>Play with keyboard and mouse, or in VR through SteamVR. Flatscreen and VR players share the same night.</p>\r\n<h3>ONE NIGHT, ONE CONTRACT</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Fill the rack.</strong> Carry battery cells out of the dark compounds to the generator. The first cell wakes the station; a full rack arms the button that calls your ride.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Survey what&#x27;s out there.</strong> Observe the Scolomorph, the wildlife and the ruined sites for bounties worth far more than the generator, if you are willing to stay for them.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Call the ride, and be on it.</strong> Somebody has to press the button. The helicopter waits a little for stragglers, and then it leaves.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Spend it and go again.</strong> Earnings carry over. Buy torches, backpacks, scanners and noisemakers between contracts, climb the tiers, and take a worse night for hazard pay: a sandstorm, a moonless sky, or torches that come out of stores nearly flat.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>THE SCOLOMORPH</h3>\r\n<p>It changes over the course of a night, and each change breaks the rule the last one taught you.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Underground</strong>, it is blind and hunts vibration. What you stand on decides how far your footsteps carry. Sand is loud, gravel is louder, rock is silent. Hold still and it loses you.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Surfaced</strong>, it hunts body heat, climbs walls and pounces from the rooftops. Holding still no longer saves you, but a torch beam drives it off.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Airborne</strong>, it circles overhead, spits acid, and steers by your light.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The louder the night, the sooner it changes. Every animal it catches makes more of it.</p>\r\n<h3>FEATURES</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Co-op for 1 to 4 players over LAN or direct IP, or play alone</li>\r\n<li>Proximity voice chat, and the creature hears it too</li>\r\n<li>Crossplay between keyboard-and-mouse and SteamVR players</li>\r\n<li>A desert that is alive: deer, rabbits, kangaroo rats, coyotes, vultures, lizards and bats, and mockingbirds that repeat your crewmates&#x27; voices back at you</li>\r\n<li>Five places to scavenge, from the generator station and two villages to a military base and an abandoned cottage, joined by dry washes, a rock shelf and a ridge</li>\r\n<li>Weight that matters: a loaded survivor is slower and louder, so every trip is a choice between carrying two cells or six</li>\r\n<li>Go down and a crewmate can bring you back; alone, you can drag yourself up if you are quiet about it</li>\r\n<li>Full 3D audio, with rooms that sound like rooms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>EARLY ACCESS</h3>\r\n<p>Xerophobia is made by a solo developer and is in active development. Version 0.4.0 turns it into a co-op game. A contract can be played from the drop to the payout, balance is being tuned from real playtests, and some environments are still placeholder art. Your early access purchase funds that work directly.</p>\r\n<p>Online play currently connects by IP address. To play with friends outside your home network, the host needs to forward UDP port 27015, or everyone can join the same virtual LAN (for example Tailscale or ZeroTier).</p>\r\n<h3>SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit</li>\r\n<li>A graphics card with Vulkan support</li>\r\n<li>Keyboard and mouse; a microphone for voice chat (optional)</li>\r\n<li>VR (optional): a SteamVR headset, or Quest 2/3 through Quest Link or Air Link. Choose <em>Play in VR</em> in the itch app, or start <code>Xerophobia.exe --vr</code></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>CONTROLS</h3>\r\n<p><strong>WASD</strong> move · <strong>Shift</strong> sprint · <strong>Ctrl</strong> or <strong>C</strong> crouch · <strong>Space</strong> jump<br>\r\n<strong>Left / right mouse</strong> reach and grab with your left / right hand · <strong>F</strong> use torch or scanner<br>\r\n<strong>Q</strong> throw (<strong>V</strong> / <strong>B</strong> to throw from a chosen hand) · <strong>E</strong> interact with a free hand, or put something down · <strong>Tab</strong> drop backpack<br>\r\n<strong>T</strong> push-to-talk (when enabled in voice settings) · <strong>Esc</strong> menu</p>\r\n<h3>FEEDBACK</h3>\r\n<p>Bug reports and playtest notes are what shape each update. Come and tell me what happened to your crew:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/g5czkmqP2G\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://discord.gg/g5czkmqP2G</a></li>\r\n<li>X / Twitter: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LostRabbitVR\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://twitter.com/LostRabbitVR</a></li>\r\n<li>Roadmap: <a href=\"https://trello.com/b/4R19IQ59\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://trello.com/b/4R19IQ59</a></li>\r\n<li>Press and streamers: <a href=\"https://lostrabbit.digital/streamers\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://lostrabbit.digital/streamers</a></li>\r\n</ul></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" height=\"6\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0